{"schema_version":2,"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","events":[{"id":"houfei-e-o005a","title":"曹操于谯纳卞氏为妾","accounts":[{"id":"houfei-e-o005a-account","label":"《后妃传》正文","text":"卞氏年二十，曹操于谯纳为妾，后随至洛。","evidence":["houfei-e-o005a-q"]}],"participants":[{"person":"cao-cao","role":"纳妾","evidence":["houfei-e-o005a-q"]},{"person":"wudi-p0388","role":"入室","evidence":["houfei-e-o005a-q"]}],"place":{"text":"谯","evidence":["houfei-q-o005"]},"time":{"label":"卞氏年二十","precision":"undated","basis":"保留本条时间表达，不据相邻段落自动补年。","evidence":["houfei-e-o005a-q"]},"ordering_evidence":"houfei-e-o005a-q","source_order":[5,22,"O005a"],"order":1336}],"persons":[{"id":"cao-cao","name":"曹操","facts":[],"aliases":[]},{"id":"wudi-p0388","name":"卞夫人","facts":[],"aliases":[]}],"evidence":[{"id":"houfei-e-o005a-q","section":"chapter-005","block":"b-05a1b9e74257021c7f9d","layer":"original","quote":"年二十，太祖于谯纳后为妾，后随太祖至洛。","section_title":"后妃传第五","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0015.xhtml","index":21,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":33,"end":53,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"houfei-q-o005","section":"chapter-005","block":"b-05a1b9e74257021c7f9d","layer":"original","quote":"武宣卞皇后〖1〗，琅邪开阳人〖2〗。文帝母也。本倡家〖3〗。﹝一﹞年二十，太祖于谯纳后为妾，后随太祖至洛。及董卓为乱，太祖微服东出避难〖4〗。袁术传太祖凶问〖5〗，时太祖左右至洛者，皆欲归。后止之曰：“曹君吉凶未可知！今日还家，明日若在，何面目复相见也？正使祸至〖6〗，共死何苦〖7〗？”遂从后言。太祖闻而善之。","section_title":"后妃传第五","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0015.xhtml","index":21,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":156,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"}],"profiles":{},"directory_counts":{}}
